- `JamHazardRules::Tick` and `Hits`: `Jam.Boss.SlamHurtsOnlyAfterTheTelegraph`,
  `Jam.Boss.SlamMissesAHeroWhoLeftTheCircle`.

## Done

Block B is complete: build and tests green, commit, a clip, three lines in `DEVLOG.md`.

